@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Home Page";
}

<div class="text-center">
    <h1 class="display-4">Welcome to Survey Says</h1>
</div>

<div class="text-left">
    <p>
        This is an application that can be used for safe tip transfers. A conversation with my mother 
        inspired me to create this project. For many years, my mother worked in the housekeeping industry 
        and has a multitude of stories to tell. One issue she experienced was that housekeepers would 
        sometimes take tips from rooms they did not work in. Although there are similar tip-transfer 
        applications, such as Venmo, I wanted to build something specifically designed for the hotel 
        industry that would allow guests to safely send tips directly to the housekeeper who serviced 
        their room.         
    </p>
</div>

<div class="text-left">
    <h2>How SafeTips works:</h2>
    <p>
        <ol>
            <li>
                1. Guests scan the QR code associated with their room
            </li>
            <li>
                2. The guest can see who serviced their room.
            </li>
            <li>
                3. The guest chooses an amount and securely sends the tip.
            </li>
            <li>
                4. Guests can optionally leave a thank-you message.
            </li>
        </ol>
    </p>
</div>